WEBVTT

00:00:00.702 --> 00:00:02.911
Markets grew a third thing this month.

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:07.911
Both legs move, or neither does. There is no half-settled trade.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:12.441
It sits in Markets, beside Treasury and Embedded Yield.

00:00:13.076 --> 00:00:16.486
Open it, and every trade shows the stage it is actually at.

00:00:17.129 --> 00:00:20.380
Pick one, and you see both legs and who is holding what.

00:00:20.943 --> 00:00:25.121
The escrow holds your leg. It is yours until the other side funds theirs.

00:00:25.999 --> 00:00:28.580
It is in the prototype now. Have a look.
